A <ref cls=\"net/minecraft/client/renderer/SubmitNodeCollector\">SubmitNodeCollector</ref> that bridges the submission based rendering back to a <ref cls=\"net/minecraft/client/renderer/MultiBufferSource\">MultiBufferSource</ref>. Used by <ref cls=\"org/moddingx/libx/render/RenderHelper\" method=\"renderItem\" type=\"(net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack,net.minecraft.world.item.ItemDisplayContext,com.mojang.blaze3d.vertex.PoseStack,net.minecraft.client.renderer.MultiBufferSource,int,int)void\">RenderHelper#renderItem</ref> to render items inside a <ref cls=\"org/moddingx/libx/render/target/RenderJob\">org.moddingx.libx.render.target.RenderJob</ref> without requiring callers to implement all abstract methods of <ref cls=\"net/minecraft/client/renderer/SubmitNodeCollector\">SubmitNodeCollector</ref>."}}
